#: kcmlayout.cpp:91
msgid "&Enable keyboard layouts"
msgstr "&Galluogi cynlluniau bysellfwrdd"

#: kcmlayout.cpp:92
msgid " Here you can completely disable this module, for example if you use other tools for switching keyboard layouts."
msgstr "Yma gallwch analluogi'r modiwl yma'n hollol, er enghraifft os ydych yn defnyddio offer eraill i newid cynlluniau bysellfwrdd."

#: kcmlayout.cpp:108
msgid "Keyboard &model:"
msgstr "&Model bysellfwrdd:"

#: kcmlayout.cpp:111
msgid " Here you can choose a keyboard model. This setting is independent of your keyboard layout and refers to the \"hardware\" model, i.e. the way your keyboard is manufactured. Modern keyboards that come with your computer usually have two extra keys and are referred to as \"104-key\" models, which is probably what you want if you don't know what kind of keyboard you have."
msgstr "Yma gallwch ddewis model bysellfwrdd. Mae'r gosodiad yma'n annibynnol o'r cyllun bysellfwrdd. Cyfeiria at fodel y \"caledwedd\" yn unig, h.y. y ffordd y gwnaed eich bysellfwrdd. Mae gan fysellfyrddau cyfoes a ddônt â'ch cyfrifiadur ddwy fysell ychwanegol ac fe'i gelwir yn fodelau \"104-bysyll\", sef beth fyddwch eisiau mwy na thebyg, os nad ydych yn gwybod pa fath o fysellfwrdd sydd gennych."

#: kcmlayout.cpp:121
msgid "Pr&imary layout:"
msgstr "Pr&if gynllun:"

#: kcmlayout.cpp:124
msgid " Here you can choose your primary keyboard layout, i.e. the keyboard layout used as default. The keyboard layout defines \"which keys do what\". For example German keyboards have the letter 'Y' where US keyboards have the letter 'Z'."
msgstr "Yma gallwch ddewis eich prif gynllun bysellfwrdd, h.y. y cynllun bysellfwrdd a ddefnyddir yn ragosod. Diffinia'r cynllun bysellfwrdd \"pa fysyll sy'n gwneud beth\". Er enghraifft, mae'r lythyren 'Y' ar fysellfyrddau Almaeneg lle bo'r lythren 'Z' ar fysellfyrddau'r UDau."

#: kcmlayout.cpp:134
msgid "Prim&ary variant:"
msgstr "Prif &amrywiad:"

#: kcmlayout.cpp:137
msgid " Here you can choose a variant of your primary keyboard layout. Layout variants usually represent different key maps for the same language. For example, Ukrainian layout might have four variants: basic, winkeys (as in Windows), typewriter (as in typewriters) and phonetic (each Ukrainian letter is placed on a transliterated latin one)."
msgstr "Yma gallwch ddewis amrywiad o'ch prif gynllun bysellfwrdd. Cynrychiola amrywiadau cynllun fapiau bysyll gwahanol ar gyfer yr un iaith fel arfer. Er enghraifft, gall bod pedwar amrywiad i'r cynllun Wcrainaidd: sylfaenol, bysyllwin (fel yn Windows), teipiadur (fel ar deipiaduron) a seinyddol (lleolir pob lythyren Wcrainaidd ar drawslythyren Lladin)."

#: kcmlayout.cpp:148
msgid "Additional Layouts"
msgstr "Cynlluniau Ychwanegol"

#: kcmlayout.cpp:152
msgid " You can select an arbitrary number of additional keyboard layouts. If one or more additional layouts have been selected, the KDE panel will offer a docked flag. By clicking on this flag you can easily switch between layouts."
msgstr "Gallwch ddewis nifer mympwyol o gynlluniau bysellfwrdd ychwanegol. Os dewiswyd un neu fwy o gynlluniau ychwanegol, cynniga'r panel KDE faner docedig. Drwy glicio ar y faner yma gallwch newid yn hawdd rhwng cynlluniau."

#: kcmlayout.cpp:156
msgid "Switching Policy"
msgstr "Newid Polisi"

#: kcmlayout.cpp:159
msgid "&Global"
msgstr "&Eang"

#: kcmlayout.cpp:160
msgid "Application"
msgstr "Cymhwysiad"

#: kcmlayout.cpp:161
msgid "&Window"
msgstr "&Ffenestr"

#: kcmlayout.cpp:175
msgid "Flag"
msgstr "Baner"

#: kcmlayout.cpp:176
msgid "Layout"
msgstr "Cynllun"

#: kcmlayout.cpp:177
msgid "Keymap"
msgstr "Bysellfap"

#: kcmlayout.cpp:188
msgid "&Variant:"
msgstr "&Amrywiad:"

#: kcmlayout.cpp:192
msgid " Here you can choose a variant of the selected additional keyboard layout. Layout variants usually represent different key maps for the same language. For example, Ukrainian layout might have four variants: basic, winkeys (as in Windows), typewriter (as in typewriters) and phonetic (each Ukrainian letter is placed on a transliterated latin one)."
msgstr "Yma gallwch ddewis amrywiad o'r cynllun bysellfwrdd ychwanegol dewisiedig. Cynrychiola amrywiadau cynllun fapiau bysyll gwahanol ar gyfer yr un iaith fel arfer. Er enghraifft, gall bod pedwar amrywiad i'r cynllun Wcrainaidd: sylfaenol, bysyllwin (fel yn Windows), teipiadur (fel ar deipiaduron) a seinyddol (lleolir pob lythyren Wcrainaidd ar drawslythyren Lladin)."

#: kcmlayout.cpp:209
msgid "&Layout"
msgstr "&Cynllun"

#: kcmlayout.cpp:309
msgid "Xkb Options"
msgstr "Dewisiadau Xkb"

#: kcmlayout.cpp:312
msgid "&Reset old options"
msgstr "&Ailosod hen ddewisiadau"

#: kcmlayout.cpp:604
msgid " <h1>Keyboard Layout</h1> Here you can choose your keyboard layout and model. The 'model' refers to the type of keyboard that is connected to your computer, while the keyboard layout defines \"which key does what\" and may be different for different countries.<p> In addition to the 'Primary Layout', which will be used as the default, you can specify additional layouts, which you can easily switch between using the KDE panel."
msgstr "<h1>Cynllun Bysellfwrdd</h1>Yma gallwch ddewis cynllun a model eich bysellfwrdd. Cyfeiria'r 'model' at y math o fysellfwrdd sydd yn gysylltiedig â'ch cyfrifiadur, tra diffinia'r cynllun bysellfwrdd \"pa fysell sy'n gwneud beth\" a gall fod yn wahanol i wahanol wledydd.<p> Yn ogystal â'r 'Prif Gynllun', a ddefnyddir yn ragosod, gallwch benodi cynlluniau ychwanegol, y gallwch newid rhyngddynt yn hawdd drwy ddefnyddio'r panel KDE."

